 (accessed on 15 December 2019).\nScheerder, J.; Breedveld, K.; Borgers, J. Who Is Doing a Run with the Running Boom? In Running across\nEurope; Palgrave Macmillan UK: London, UK, 2015; pp. 1–27.\nHespanhol Junior, L.C.; Pillay, J.D.; van Mechelen, W.; Verhagen, E. Meta-Analyses of the Eﬀects of Hab", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "eed to the published version of the manuscript.\nConﬂicts of Interest: The authors declare no conﬂict of interest.\nBramble, D.M.; Lieberman, D.E. Endurance running and the evolution of Homo. Nature 2004, 432, 345–352.\nLieberman, D.E. Human Locomotion"}
