e volume, intensity, and distance depending on the\ntraining phase, and race distance. Both long and medium aerobic\ninterval training were conducted at vLT2 in z2 and were charac-\nterized by short recovery periods of 1 minute or", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "Meta-Analysis (PRISMA) ﬂow diagram of the article selections.\nTraining Characteristics and Performance in Highly Trained Runners\nUnauthenticated | Downloaded 06/08/26 09:35 PM UTC"}
