2 and one to\n2 sessions at race pace\nof the total training volume was\nperformed at z1 and z3, respec-\ntively. HVPyr: M: 174 (17)\nof the total training volume were\nperformed in z1, z2, and z3,\nLVPol: 2 IT sessions per week\nvVO2max, 7 × 200 m at 120% of\nvVO2max, or a session at an inter-\nmediate velocity between v", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "Characteristics of Included Studies and Performance and Training Characteristics of Athletes Participating in Each Study\nTraining methods (those\ndescribed in the studies)\nPyramidal model: 80% at z1 and\n20% at z2 at or close to vLT2 during\nall periods"}
