arch question, is rather which is\nthe most effective combination of methods to improve perfor-\nmance and its physiological determinants according to the\nspeciﬁc athlete and competitive goal. Within these different\ncombinations observed, interval training methods typically\nwere conducted at z3 and ", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "ngly, it is not possible to know whether the use of a different model\n(ie, block or reverse periodization) would have led to different\noutcomes. Therefore, further research comparing the outcomes\nderived from using different periodization models may"}
