ent article. Author\ncontributions: Casado and González-Mohíno collected the data, analyzed\nthe data, and wrote the manuscript; González-Ravé collected the data and\nwrote the manuscript; Foster wrote the manuscript and reviewed a draft of\n1. Billat LV, Koralsztein JP. Signiﬁcance of the velocity at ", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "2009.\n15. Billat LV. Interval training for performance: a scientiﬁc and empirical\npractice. Special recommendations for middle- and long-distance\nrunning. Part I: aerobic interval training. Sports Med. 2001;31(2):\n16. Tjelta LI. The training of inte"}
