a TT test\nthat required participants to complete a set distance; 5. and programmed", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "Interval training has become an essential component of endurance\ntraining programs because it can facilitate a substantial improvement in\nendurance sport performance. Two forms of interval training that are\ncommonly used to improve endurance sport pe"}
