 TT test\nthat required participants to complete a set distance; 5. and programmed", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "to improve endurance sport performance are high-\nintensity interval training (HIIT) and sprint interval training (SIT). Despite\nextensive research, there is no consensus concerning the optimal\nmethod to manipulate the interval training programming v"}
