 a TT test\nthat required participants to complete a set distance; 5. and programmed", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "nterval training programming variables to\nmaximize endurance performance for differing individuals.\nThe objective of this manuscript was to perform a systematic review and\nmeta-analysis of interval training studies to determine the influence that\nind"}
