.; Duenwald‐Kuehl, S.E.; Lakes, R.S.; Vanderby, R. Relationship between tendon stiffness and failure: A\nThornton, G.M.; Hart, D.A. The interface of mechanical loading and biological variables as they pertain to the development of\ntendinosis. J. Musculoskelet. Neuronal Interact. 2011, 11, 94–105.\nWinnicki, K.; Ochała‐Kłos, A.; Rutowicz, B.; Pę", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "; Verhaar, J.A.N.; Bierma‐Zeinstra, S.M.A.; Tol, J.L.\nIncidence of midportion Achilles tendinopathy in the general population. Br. J. Sports Med. 2011, 45, 1026–1028.\nLopes, A.D.; Hespanhol, L.C.; Yeung, S.S.; Costa, L.O.P. What are the Main Running‐"}
