nning is deﬁned as participa-\ntion below age 18. Jumping/multidi-\nrectional loading sports (soccer,\nbasketball) may optimize bone health.\nPsychological development requires\nmonitoring to reduce risk of injuries\nand burnout. Adequate energy avail-\nability is essential for health; screening\nfor disordered eating and optimizing\nnutrition is important. Injuries during\ngrowth spu", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "mpact loading or\nhigher bone mineral density (BMD)\nand enhanced bone geometry at the\nanatomical sites speciﬁc to the loading\ndemands of the given activity (56). By\ncontrast, the repetitive impact loading\nfrom running alone does not provide\npredictabl"}
