mme is developed by working in reverse chronological order from the\ndate of the main competition or training objective and dividing the training season into\nthe appropriate number of training periods.\nEach period has different aims and, to some extent, will continue the application of the\nconcepts of training load and the wave principle", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "uccessive training\nsessions up to the athlete’s maximum load capability (for example 50%, 75%, 100%)\nand followed by a very light training session or a complete rest. This applies to training\nprogrammes of five or more sessions per week. If the frequ"}
