ng each work period.\nThe short interval is very important during the regatta season to keep a good quantity\nof training in the right area of race velocity, and use of stroke rate valid for competition.\nTraining after the interval principle will increase or maintain the heart’s stroke volume\n(increased aerobic capacity).\nTraining with main", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "stant during each work period.\nThe short interval is very important during the regatta season to keep a good quantity\nof training in the right area of race velocity, and use of stroke rate valid for competition.\nTraining after the interval principle"}
