n I push myself while running… - … I talk about a variety of things.\nWhen I push myself while running… - … I don’t talk to myself.\nWhen I run without pushing myself… - … I talk in long sentences.\nWhen I run without pushing myself… - … I talk in short sentences.\nWhen I run without pushing myself… - … I repeat the same words again and again.\nWhen I run without pu", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "- … I wonder what others are thinking about me.\nWhen I run without pushing myself… - … I talk to myself about all sorts of other things than running.\nWhen I run without pushing myself… - … I don’t talk to myself.\nWhen I push myself while running… -"}
