 may im-\nprove VO2max and endurance capacity. A meta-analysis\nwas completed by Pelletier and researchers [617] to\nsummarize the potential impact of quercetin supplemen-\ntation on endurance performance. This analysis involved\nseven published studies representing 288 research partici", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "th largely\nmixed results. For example, Greer and investigators [637]\nexamined the ability of arginine + alpha-ketoglutarate and\nreported that the combination did not significantly impact\nmuscle endurance and significantly reduced the number\nof chin-u"}
