s/50 km (Blackwater Trail -\nFlorida, USA); 56 miles/90 km (Comrades Marathon -\nDurban, South Africa); 100 miles/161 km (Western States\nEndurance Run - California, USA); and 152 miles/245 km\n(Spartathlon – Athens, Greece). Moreover, such races\ntypically last between 6 and 48 h. The distances of mu", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "ter of which is highly\nvariable, for example: 31 miles/50 km (Blackwater Trail -\nFlorida, USA); 56 miles/90 km (Comrades Marathon -\nDurban, South Africa); 100 miles/161 km (Western States\nEndurance Run - California, USA); and 152 miles/245 km\n(Sparta"}
