 gains, according to\nthe event, the speciﬁc scenario of use and the individual Athlete’s\ngoals and responsiveness (Table 5). Speciﬁc challenges include\ndeveloping protocols to manage repeated use of performance supple-\nments in multi-event or heat ﬁnal competitions or the interaction\nbetwe", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "tion/\nacclimatization to optimize performance in hot/humid environ-\nmental conditions (e.g., 2019 IAAF Doha World Championships)\nis a common and well-supported practice. However, the use of heat\ntraining to improve exercise capacity in temperate envi"}
