npsychological coping,self-esteem, life meaning, recognition and\n298,082 finishers in the New York City\nAverage speed from each\nDeviations in average\nspeed from each segments,\nNationality may influence pacing.Ethiopians and Kenyans adopt a\nrelatively more even pace during the New York city Marathon which\nis shown by their small changes in race speed and", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "enyans adopt a\nrelatively more even pace during the New York city Marathon which\nis shown by their small changes in race speed and by practicing the\nend spurt less than other nationalities.\n501 finishers in the Rio 24h Ultra-\nAverage speed from each"}
