th\nspecific recommendations presented in Table 3 [2, 33, 36,\nOf the studies that stated a frequency of initial runs, 42%\nrecommended starting with alternate days [2, 5, 22, 36,\nwith several studies specifying this should be maintained\nfor times ranging from 2 [36, 73, 74] to 4 weeks [2, 64]\n(Table 3). Other st", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "a specific running distance that should\nbe achieved before speed changes, ranging from 1 mile to\nthe progression of distance, five studies suggested ‘the 10%\nrule’ as a guideline to progress running speed [2, 38, 43, 77,\n86]. Other recommendations re"}
