: the ‘niggle’, the ‘persisting niggle’, and the ‘non-responding niggle’. These\nthree entities describe levels of injury which become increasingly more severe in terms of their\nphysical description, their outcome (effect on running and daily life), their psychological\ndescrip", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "more severe in terms of their\nphysical description, their outcome (effect on running and daily life), their psychological\ndescription, and the management strategies required. However, amongst these three levels of\nniggle, there is a further lower le"}
