rom prospective studies that evaluated\nuninjured runners who were followed over the\nstudy time period (new injuries analysis). Informa-\ntion regarding prevalence was extracted from\nretrospective and/or cross-sectional studies[20]\nthat did not include injured runners only in the\nsubject population. As the ", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "s injuries.[21]\nTable I. Search strategies for each database\nRunning AND injuries\nLimit: scientific journal\n1 AND 2 AND 3\n5 AND 6 AND 7\n5 AND 6 AND 7\nTotal number of articles retrieved for each database.\nLILACS = Latin American and Caribbean Center o"}
