 tendon pathology in National Basketball As­\nsociation players. Clin Res Foot Ankle. 2016;4:205. https://doi.\n7. \u0007Andia I, Maffulli N. Clinical outcomes of biologic treatment for chronic ten­\n8. \u0007Arya S, Kulig K. Tendinopathy alters mechanical and material properties of\nthe Achilles tendon. J Appl Physiol (1985). 2010", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "ividuals. J Electromyogr\n14. \u0007Beyer R, Kongsgaard M, Hougs Kjaer B, Øhlenschlæger T, Kjaer M, Mag­\nnusson SP. Heavy slow resistance versus eccentric training as treatment\nfor Achilles tendinopathy: a randomized controlled trial. Am J Sports Med.\n15."}
