wer diagnostics for phase progression during return to sport (RTS)\nConsiderations for RTS load planning\nStrength/power diagnostics\nProgression of running speeds (>70% maximal speed)\nProgression of acceleration/deceleration magnitudes (intensity)\nAppropriate stage to combine sprint distance and ch", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "s—passing, shooting, jumping/landing actions\nIso squat PF, RFD (FP)\nIso quadriceps PF (HHD)\nDyn split squat force/impulse asymmetries (FP)\nCon/ecc quadriceps PT (IKD)\nProgression of running volumes (total distance, HSR, sprint distance)\nProgression o"}
