elieve that the higher\nportion was due to the unsupervised nature of the data as well\nas the low threshold of > 0.8 · hrmax we set to verify the best\n10 km performances. However, increasing the threshold of hrmax\nto elevate the cardiopulmonary eﬀort for the best 10 km velocities\ndid no", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "eneral 1v10 likely reﬂects an improved\nphysical ﬁtness, even though the cause for the improvement may\nvary between individuals (e.g., improvement due to following a\nspeciﬁc training structure with fast runs at the end of the 16\nweeks training period)"}
