ctor changes following endurance exercise\nImmediately after the race, no changes in Hct could be observed\nPlatelet count increased by 1.3-fold\nActivity of FVIII increased by 3.1-fold and vWF:Ag activity increased by 3.3-fold\nSignificant elevation of β-Thromboglobulin up to 24 h afte", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "Braschler et al. Sports Medicine - Open (2025) 11:10\naPTT activated partial thromboplastin time, FVIII factor VIII, Hb hemoglobin, Hct hematocrit, LDH lactate dehydrogenase, MCH mean corpuscular hemoglobin, MCV mean corpuscular volume, OR odds ratio,"}
