ts the main findings and\nresults of the said studies.\nBiomarkers of Inflammation\nIn addition to the clear benefits of marathon training on\nthe immune system, high-intensity endurance exercise\nalso carries risks for immune function. After a marathon\nrace, various adverse effects on the immune", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "hon running puts immense\nstress on the immune system and its function [36]. Over\nthe past decades, the role of the immune system in asso-\nciation with endurance exercise enjoyed much research\ninterest. It became clear that physical activity strongly"}
