sts the main findings and\nresults of the said studies.\nBiomarkers of Inflammation\nIn addition to the clear benefits of marathon training on\nthe immune system, high-intensity endurance exercise\nalso carries risks for immune function. After a marathon\nrace, various adverse effects on the immune", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "-intensity endurance exercise\nalso carries risks for immune function. After a marathon\nrace, various adverse effects on the immune system may\nFirstly, significant changes in inflammatory biomark-\ners were observed. As described in the previous sectio"}
