e neuroprotective role of\nregular endurance exercise, especially in patients with\nmild cognitive impairment, dementia or even Parkinson’s\ndisease. In addition, marathon training has a very posi-\ntive influence on psychological well-being and mental\nhealth. Nevertheless, the influence of marat", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "athletes and\ncoaches are appropriately educated about early symp-\nThe influence of marathon training and running on the\ncentral nervous system has not been extensively stud-\nied so far. However, there is evidence that acute bouts of\nextreme endurance"}
