y to exhaustion until they no longer maintain the\nrequired work rate (e.g., speed or power output) [33,37]. _VO2max is defined as the maximal\noxygen consumption rate measured during incremental exercise [41]. EM is defined as the\noxygen consumption during exercise", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "SE. An electronic search was conducted that included all publication years\n(up to and including September 18, 2022). Reviewers used the following Boolean search\nphrases in all of the above-mentioned databases: (taper*) AND (endurance training OR endu"}
