ity to exhaustion until they no longer maintain the\nrequired work rate (e.g., speed or power output) [33,37]. _VO2max is defined as the maximal\noxygen consumption rate measured during incremental exercise [41]. EM is defined as the\noxygen consumption during exercise", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "ring and endurance events.\nEligibility criteria\nWe included studies that fulfilled the following criteria: 1) Participants: subjects were endur-\nance athletes ( _VO2max > 55 ml/kg/min) [43]. If the included studies did not provide _VO2max\nvalues, tra"}
