ty to exhaustion until they no longer maintain the\nrequired work rate (e.g., speed or power output) [33,37]. _VO2max is defined as the maximal\noxygen consumption rate measured during incremental exercise [41]. EM is defined as the\noxygen consumption during exercise", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "ot provide _VO2max\nvalues, training status was determined by the classification used in each study, and the partici-\npants were at least well-trained athletes [44,45]; 2) Interventions: the experimental design pro-\nvided detailed pre-competition tape"}
