so influenced by intensity, volume, fre-\nquency, and individual differences [1,89]. Recovery from a reduction in training load varies\nbetween individuals, with no clear timeline, implying that the corresponding optimal taper\nduration also varies [90]. Unfortunate", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "the optimal taper duration for\ncycling and running. However, the effect of taper is also influenced by intensity, volume, fre-\nquency, and individual differences [1,89]. Recovery from a reduction in training load varies\nbetween individuals, with no"}
