ith few\nfemale ones. The results may not be able to represent both male and female athletes in\n3. Although this meta-analysis elaborated on the effect of pre-competition taper on the perfor-\nmance of endurance athletes, there were specific differences in the physi", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "suggested that the choice of the two exponential-taper types or\npatterns should be combined with taper duration, with preference given to the fast-decay pat-\ntern if taper duration is short and to the slow-decay pattern in cases of longer taper durat"}
