entially an extension and refinement\nof the latter. Both are relevant for the meticulous regulation of\ntraining programs and the precise management of training load\nThe three-zone concept has been successfully improved by the\nmany training zone classification t", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "training.\nTABLE 4 Intensity level and standard of Chinese kayak team water training load.\nPaddle Frequency (times/minute)\nK1 is a single, K2 is a double and K4 is a quad.\nFor instance, a comparison of the initial three-zone model\n(Z1–Z3) with the mo"}
