and theoretical foundations of TID throughout\nvarious training durations have thus been a primary topic of\ninvestigation in this domain.\n4.1 TID during the preparation phase\nThe general preparation phase initiates the macrocyc", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "osting movement economy and sport-specific\nperformance (Li, 2015).\nThe TID structure in this phase may differ depending on\nthe training level. Although the deliberate incorporation of Zone\nFrontiers in Physiology"}
