r elite endurance athletes: a narrative review. Sports\n34. Budgett R. Overtraining and chronic fatigue: the unexplained under-\nperformance syndrome (UPS). Int Sportmed J. 2000;1(3):16–27.\n35. Tian Y, He Z, Zhao J, et al. An 8-year longitudinal study of over-\nreaching in 114 elite female Chinese w", "keywords_zh": [], "keywords_en": [], "synonyms": [], "domain_terms": ["training_protocol"], "text": "Mujika I, Paquet JB, Arvisais D, Bosquet L.\nEffects of tapering on neuromuscular and metabolic ﬁtness in team\nsports: a systematic review and meta-analysis. Eur J Sport Sci. 2021;\n33. Mujika I, Sharma AP, Stellingwerff T. Contemporary periodization"}
